HOTA RAHEGA SHAAM O SAHER AOUN O MOHD KA MATAM TUKDE KAREGA QALB O JIGAR AOUN O MOHD KA MATAM<br>
<br>
1 RAN SE JAB AAYE LAASHE PISAR SAJDAYE HAQ MEIN THI MADAR<br>
KARNA SAKI WOH JI BHAR KAR AOUN O MOHD KA MATAM<br>
<br>
2. ZIKR JAB AAYE ZAINAB KA GIRYA KARENGE AHLE AZA HASHR TALAK HOGA GHAR GHAR AOUN O MOHD KA MATAM<br>
<br>
3. RAN SE KHAIMAIYE ZAINAB PAR CHAK GARIBA KHAK BASAR KARTE HOVE AAYE SARWAR AOUN O MOHD KA MATAM<br>
<br>
4. LETE RAHO ZEHRA KI DUA ZIKRE SHAHDEEN KARKE BUKA KARTE RAHO BE QUAF O QATAR AOUN O MOHD KA MATAM<br>
<br>
 5. DETE RAHENGE AHLE AZA SANIYE ZEHRA KO PURSA HOKE KARENGE KHOON MEIN TAR AOUN O MOHD KA MATAM<br>
<br>
6. HASHR MEIN USKI BAQSHISH KA DEKH YAHI SAMAN HOGA DIL SE KARENGA GA JO MAZHER AOUN O MOHD KA MATAM<br>
<br>
